<https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24305240> <https://w3id.org/fdo-squirrel/context> "Self-built (own design, no commercial set) by Florian Thiery. Shown at the Apothekertrakt of Schönbrunn Palace during CHNT31, 2026-11-12 (https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/6892072). The figure on top is read as a medieval warrior; that and any further identification are open hypotheses, not confirmed." .
<https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24305240> <https://w3id.org/fdo-squirrel/documentationPurpose> "Test case for FDOx packaging of a scan and its reconstruction." .
