<https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24305343> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Idealised reconstruction of a white stepped LEGO pyramid (nine levels) with a five-brick column and a minifigure-style warrior figure on top (spiked helmet, mail shirt, tunic, cloak), a hobby build by Florian Thiery, rebuilt procedurally from clean LEGO bricks after a KIRI Engine scan. Only dimensions and structure were read from the scan; no scan mesh or texture was reused. AI disclosure: the reconstruction was generated with Claude (Anthropic, claude-sonnet-5-5) on behalf of Florian Thiery. It is an interpretation model, not a measurement." .
<https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24305343> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> "10.5281/zenodo.24305344" .
<https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24305343> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-11-17"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
