<https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24305343> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/provenance> "{\"ai_involvement\": \"Generated with Claude (Anthropic, claude-sonnet-5-5), session 2026-11-12 to 2026-11-17\", \"figure\": \"Modelled from 11 photographs supplied by Florian Thiery, 32.3 mm tall, painted head and torso textures\", \"known_deviations\": \"Cloak, hands and sleeves paler than in the photos; mail shirt as honeycomb pattern; cheek guards flat; sleeves plain tubes\", \"method\": \"Procedural rebuild from idealised bricks (script build_lego3.py), not a cleaned scan mesh\", \"random_seed\": \"numpy.random.default_rng(11)\", \"reproducibility\": \"Re-running the script reproduces lego.glb byte-identically with Python 3.13.18, numpy 2.5.3, trimesh 5.2.1, Pillow 12.3.0, scipy 1.18.1 (sha256 cf51067881aef419856a403725c1352c7c7d14715f286018066991afbc1e9569)\", \"scale\": \"2/3 of real LEGO dimensions (8 mm grid, 9.6 mm brick height, 4.8 mm studs), fitted to the scan\", \"structure\": \"9 levels (14x18 down to 2x2 studs) plus a column of 5 1x1 bricks; 97x 2x4, 5x 2x2, 5x 1x1, all white\"}" .
