<https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24305428> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/provenance> "KIRI Engine export (OBJ with MTL and JPG texture). 53,482 triangles and 26,996 vertices after merging duplicate vertices; not watertight; unit unknown; rotated by about 16 degrees against the ground, compressed along one axis by a factor of about 0.72, ground plane included; no clean-up applied." .
