<https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24305428> <https://w3id.org/fdo-squirrel/context> "Self-built (own design, no commercial set) by Daria Stefan (TU Wien). Shown at the Apothekertrakt of Schönbrunn Palace during CHNT31, 2026-11-12 (https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/6892072). Identification as a Maya-style stepped pyramid with a temple was confirmed by the builder. A specific model such as El Castillo (Chichén Itzá) is NOT confirmed." .
<https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24305428> <https://w3id.org/fdo-squirrel/documentationPurpose> "Test case for FDOx packaging of a scan and its reconstruction." .
